# SHA-256 of the public certificate of the fixed debug key (D56). Public, not a secret:
# Android shows it to anyone who has the APK. CI's debug APKs must carry it
# (tools/check-apk-cert.sh); local builds have it when ~/.android/debug.keystore is that key.
